WEBVTT

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
Run at once towards a dream

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.810
yume no mukou e ikkini hashitte yo

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
Let’s meet and laugh away yesterday’s troubles

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.780
nayameru kinou wo fungiri warai aou

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
When our memories were here,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:44.860
omoide ga itta no toki mo

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
even though we are deeply hurt, go straight on

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.060
kizu wo fukai no ni massugu mae ni

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.620
GO TO NEW WORLD

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:54.470
I can feel it in the wind

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:54.470
kaze no naka kanjiteru yo

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
The hot beat is shining

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:58.130
atsui kodou kagayaku yo

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
especially now…

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.610
ima koso

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
surely, always, you’ll be by my side

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.550
kitto zutto soba ni iru yo ne

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
Keep on running the way to the future.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:12.410
mirai no michi wo hashiri tsuzukeyou

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
more and more, no matter what happens

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:17.300
motto motto nani ga okitemo

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
half our tears become double smiles

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.510
namida wa hanbun nibai no egao ni naru

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
forever

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.060
itsudemo

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:44.770
Say…

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.080
Er… Well…

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:51.900
Umm…

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.570
So, I mean…

00:02:58.650 --> 00:02:59.910
Seconds.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.350
Is this a present?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:43.700
Yeah.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.050
Please choose the wrapping paper you’d like.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:49.150
Umm… This one.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.400
Which ribbon would you like?

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.250
Err… yes.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:52.850
This one.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.100
I can create a free point card for you…

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:56.750
Hold on!

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.050
What are you doing?

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.800
I told you I wouldn’t buy you a toy, didn’t I?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.810
Is it okay if mommy starts hating you?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.100
Is it okay if I hate you?

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.270
I didn’t think I would be able to make it up to them with just this, though.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.200
Excuse me…

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.410
Do you have any business with us?

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.500
The coffee is ready.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.600
It’s a nice office, isn’t it?

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.400
What?

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:57.250
Even though this is my first time here, I feel relaxed.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.900
It feels like somehow, I’ve known this nostalgic place all along.

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:06.660
I can see why the girls thought of this place as their home.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:07.870
What?

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.300
Mitsugi Kimihiko.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.460
The Shirogane sisters’ guardian.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.750
Well, well. It would have been fine if it had just ended as a rumor.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.840
He just kept going on about it.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:25.900
That guy… I don’t really know if he does that sort of work or not, but at night,

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:29.200
he said something about a big spider, and that it grew into something outrageous.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.050
“Wouldn’t it be better if you calmed down a bit?
You will never know what will happen, you know.”

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:34.900
But then I told him that there wasn’t any need to worry about anything.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.570
That’s why Sugisaki-san… No. Michiru-san.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.350
Next time why don’t the two of us go fishing for crayfish--

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:40.400
Ah, hold on a bit.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.400
Nidaime?

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:52.900
I’m sorry.

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:54.160
If I suddenly made you feel bad…

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.160
Mitsugi-san.

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.270
Never mind. It’s nothing… at all.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:09.990
Tomorrow…

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.350
Why not tomorrow?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.150
Will you really be all right from here on?

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:28.260
Well then, I’ll wait for your call.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:43.250
Those girls are the daughters of my father’s benefactor.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.700
After their parents passed away due to an accident,

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.450
my father took them into our home.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:48.350
And then,

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.450
after my father passed away,

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.000
I took care of them.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:54.960
Here is my card.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:01.650
Representative director of Mitsugi Heavy Industries, CEO of Mitsugi Semiconductors…

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:04.100
Futaba-kun?

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:05.890
May I sit?

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.350
O-Oh, please do so.

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.200
Sorry for not noticing.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.950
Um… you can help yourself to the coffee too, if you’d like.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:14.550
It might not be very sweet, though.

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:17.220
Thank you. I’ll have some.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.200
Acting as their foster parent,

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.110
I wanted to make some effort in my own way.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:29.550
The thing that those girls need has to be given freely.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.780
But, nobody can live
on scraps of bread alone.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:38.790
Despite my efforts, I wasn’t able to become a real guardian to them.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:41.950
Won’t you eat?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:53.500
Won’t you eat?

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:58.700
I am really thankful to you.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:00.910
I was unable to comfort them,

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:06.320
but you filled the emptiness in Sara’s and Soujyu’s hearts with warmth.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:10.750
Ever since the girls met you, it’s been as if they were different people.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.500
No…

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.980
When they were in this office,

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:19.330
that’s probably when they’ve been the real Shirogane Sara and Shirogane Soujyu.

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:29.600
Huh?

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:31.750
Huh…

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:33.350
That’s weird.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:01.280
I am their fiancé.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:02.290
What?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.050
On Sara’s and Soujyu’s sixteenth birthday,

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:11.340
I <i>have</i> to marry one of them.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:14.900
In the case of that not being accomplished,

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.340
I’ll… lose my position as the head of the Mitsugi family.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.150
Yes, that’s today.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:36.030
Our worlds… are totally different.

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.050
Sara-chan.

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.150
Hm?

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.410
What will we do? Today…

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:22.950
Should we stop?

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:29.290
Even if we don’t do it, there might be a way to be together.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:31.300
Until tomorrow…

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.800
We only have today left.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:39.800
But…

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.100
I am scared, after all.

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.400
Maybe we can’t remain as we were up till now anymore.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.350
But…

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:49.140
is there a better alternative?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:52.300
We only have until tomorrow.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.410
It’s Rentarou!

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:13.520
You can prepare a report regarding this,

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.300
but the communications with the related companies

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.150
must be performed well ahead of schedule.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.940
They would not have forgotten your predecessor’s last testament.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.350
Until tomorrow--

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:24.050
Shimoshima.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.090
Yes.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:31.050
Even if I have the right to ruin their party,

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.960
we don’t know if this may be their last night together…

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.050
Why aren’t you using your own umbrellas?

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:42.800
Does it matter?

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.150
Does it matter?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.600
H-Hey!

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:49.200
Well then, there was no point in my coming to get you in the first place.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.950
Isn’t it all right?

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:54.250
Isn’t it all right?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:57.700
There!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:03.950
Boss!

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.550
Geez… Hey!

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:24.950
We’re completely soaked!

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.750
You really are soaked right through underneath.

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:27.950
What do you mean underneath?

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.650
It doesn’t matter now!

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:31.900
Your clothes became see-through now, Sara-chan!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.250
Yeah, don’t look at it!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.350
I’m not looking!

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.000
Hey, hurry up!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.550
If you don’t dry yourselves off,
you’ll catch a cold!

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:39.450
Okay!

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:40.300
Ah! Wait!

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:41.400
Wait a bit!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.600
You can come in when I yell “Okay”, okay?

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:47.600
Okay!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.650
What the heck, not even turning on the lights…

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:52.600
Boss?

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.030
What’s the matter?

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.860
Happy birthday!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:08.700
Rentarou…

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:11.220
Why…

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:12.900
Sit down quickly.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:21.400
You’re sixteen today, right?

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.650
W-Wait a bit.

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:25.950
Lighting sixteen candles is quite difficult.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.520
Thanks for waiting.

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.850
Come on, blow them out.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:47.200
It seems somehow wasteful, Sara-chan.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:47.800
Yup.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.150
Shall we go?

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:51.950
One, two-

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.500
Well then, let’s turn on the lights and eat.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.050
Wait!

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:02.550
Before that, I want my present.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.340
There’s… no time anymore.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:13.800
Let’s go, Soujyu.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.750
Where?

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:17.050
Since we don’t want to catch a cold we’ll be taking a shower.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:24.800
I am their fiancé.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:29.450
On Sara’s an Soujyu’s sixteenth birthday,

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:33.620
I <i>have</i> to marry one of them.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:37.100
In the case of that not being accomplished,

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.000
I’ll… lose my position as the head of the Mitsugi family.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.000
That’s absurd!

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:43.400
I think so too.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:45.000
But that is the will.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:50.950
My father thought that by arranging it this way, Sara and Soujyu would be happy.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.010
Both of them wouldn’t…

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.350
They know, of course.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.500
It’s neither good nor bad.

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:02.100
The two of them have lived up to today for that absolute purpose.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.700
Can you give them happiness?

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.100
I can’t give these to them.

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:43.750
I’ll leave the towels here!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:45.350
Thanks.

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:48.850
The bath wasn’t very hot before, was it?

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.790
Yes, but it’s fine today.

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:53.500
Rentarou!

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.150
What?

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:57.800
Did you meet him? Kimihiko….

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.100
Yeah.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.330
What will I do if I return?

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.510
If I return to the room… what will I do after that?

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:36.860
Ah…

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:40.870
Aren’t you going in?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.330
I’ve been thinking about many things, you know.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.350
Soujyu, are you all right?

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.300
I’ll go get your clothes.

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:51.400
Cold?

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:55.850
I’m all right.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:56.770
Thank you.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:01.850
Soujyu.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.690
This way.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:19.780
I did meet Mitsugi Kimihiko-san.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:21.950
I heard everything.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.350
Your father is a salaryman.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:27.450
Your mother is a housewife.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:28.860
Though they gave you free rein,

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:31.600
when you came to the office you’d contact them on the phone.

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:33.850
It was all a lie.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.100
Just what was this place?

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:39.950
What was I to you?

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.110
What am I?

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:49.700
If…

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:53.730
If you understood everything, what would happen?

00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:58.850
I don’t know.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:01.300
I can’t answer if I haven’t decided yet, huh?

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.250
I…

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:03.250
What can I possibly do?

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:09.120
Daite means “hold us” but it can also mean “make love to us”.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:08.120
Make love to us.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:11.990
It’s okay because
we won’t be here tomorrow.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.750
Will you answer us?

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.130
I can’t do it!

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.810
Where would it go, if we were to make love.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.100
If you were to be here tomorrow,

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:30.150
would you really be able to become happy?

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:32.150
And me…

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:33.900
What can I believe in?

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:38.150
If I made love to you and we became one, would tomorrow change at all?

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:40.400
That is…

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:42.400
That is…

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:46.000
Why does it have to be sixteen?

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.650
What happens at sixteen?

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:29.850
Hello?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.000
This is Futaba, whom you met today at noon.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.000
My apologies, but unfortunately Kimihiko-sama is out of the house.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.450
There’s nowhere that we can go now, Sara-chan.

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:56.100
What are we supposed to do, Sara-chan?

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:57.900
Your body got cold.

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.950
Wait a minute. I’ll get you
something warm over there.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:21.420
Sara-chan…

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:24.250
I am strong.

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:27.150
So even if I’m on my own, I’ll be fine.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.250
So…

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:32.230
everything will be all right from now on.

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:34.650
Right, Soujyu?

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.600
If…

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:40.050
I knew everything…

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:44.160
would I be able to do anything for them?

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:51.030
If I knew everything, would I have been together with the girls until today?

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:54.850
If I knew everything…

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:57.600
would I have been able to make love to them?

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:02.090
If I knew everything, would I…

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:14.450
If…

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.750
I knew everything…

00:22:16.750 --> 00:22:17.400
would I…

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:28.900
Inside my memories,

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:28.900
kioku no naka ni aru

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:35.040
there was a happy moment

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:35.040
shiawase na shunkan

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:41.010
within the light.

00:22:35.670 --> 00:22:41.010
hikari no naka de ita

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:47.650
It overflowed in this place.

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:47.650
afureteta kono basho de

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.050
For example, 3 years later,

00:22:48.120 --> 00:22:51.050
tatoeba sen nen go

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.260
would you be able

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.260
bokura no jikan wo

00:22:55.390 --> 00:23:01.660
to remember our time?

00:22:55.390 --> 00:23:01.660
omoida ni suru koto dekiru ka na

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.500
Ah… the days gone by

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.500
aa owatta hibi ga

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:15.010
always wrench my heart.

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:15.010
KOKORO no zutto zutto shimetsuketeku

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:20.080
Hey, more than before,

00:23:15.310 --> 00:23:20.080
nee mae yori motto

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:27.760
understand the feelings of love.

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:27.760
itoshiku omou kimochi wo shitte

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:34.660
I won’t say goodbye. Always from now on,

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:34.660
sayonara wa iwanai yo zutto kore kara mo

00:23:34.730 --> 00:23:39.300
the days of no return

00:23:34.730 --> 00:23:39.300
modoru koto no nai hibi

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:46.510
will leave your heart behind.

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:46.510
kokoro wo nokoshite

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:55.830
Next Episode Preview

